<Base title="About | howto.email"><div class="wrap page article"><h1>About howto.email</h1><p>howto.email is a free, open-source, vendor-neutral knowledge base about email infrastructure. The goal is practical documentation that works for people learning email as well as engineers operating it in production.</p><p>Coverage includes SMTP, DNS, SPF, DKIM, DMARC, TLS, deliverability, mailbox protocols, security, troubleshooting and modern email operations.</p></div></Base>